00:19:43.331 --> 00:19:45.162
I heard, Miyuki.

00:19:46.234 --> 00:19:47.602
Jeter!

00:19:47.602 --> 00:19:50.505
The girl who beat you in battle...

00:19:50.505 --> 00:19:52.874
Something happened with her, right?

00:19:52.874 --> 00:19:55.035
That has nothing to do with you.

00:19:57.112 --> 00:19:59.910
I want us to understand each other.

00:20:00.281 --> 00:20:03.118
You barely came to the academy last month!

00:20:03.118 --> 00:20:05.153
We barely even know each other!

00:20:05.153 --> 00:20:07.255
As stubborn as always.

00:20:07.255 --> 00:20:09.223
But I like that.

00:20:10.158 --> 00:20:11.557
No!

00:20:12.594 --> 00:20:17.265
For her to come after these girls
right under my nose...

00:20:17.265 --> 00:20:20.568
That transfer student is in for it.

00:20:20.568 --> 00:20:21.933
Who is she?

00:20:24.973 --> 00:20:26.641
This isn't her, either.

00:20:26.641 --> 00:20:29.439
Where is the Magdalene of Thunder?

00:20:31.346 --> 00:20:33.148
How many have I sucked so far?

00:20:33.148 --> 00:20:35.316
Twenty percent, I think.

00:20:35.316 --> 00:20:37.485
We can't seem to find it, huh?

00:20:37.485 --> 00:20:39.287
I'll suck them all until I do!

00:20:39.287 --> 00:20:43.358
Unlike yesterday, not a single person
isn't suspicious of you now.

00:20:43.358 --> 00:20:45.326
We have to find it fast.

00:20:48.429 --> 00:20:49.430
Miss Sasha!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.032
You were wonderful yesterday!

00:20:51.032 --> 00:20:53.000
Th... Thanks.

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:59.470
Jeez, those girls are so fickle!

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:04.605
Good morning, Miss Tsubasa Amano.

00:21:05.013 --> 00:21:06.814
Oh, Miss Katsuragi!

00:21:06.814 --> 00:21:08.550
Just call me Hana.

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:11.052
You're so quiet in class.

00:21:11.052 --> 00:21:14.021
I didn't even notice you until yesterday.

00:21:14.956 --> 00:21:16.758
I get that a lot.

00:21:16.758 --> 00:21:18.350
Tsubasa Amano...

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:21.460
We have to investigate this girl, too.

00:21:23.798 --> 00:21:25.959
The Magdalene of Thunder...

00:21:26.568 --> 00:21:29.162
We Adepts must attain it!

00:21:48.356 --> 00:21:54.762
Unstable, an asymmetrical trajectory

00:21:54.762 --> 00:22:01.269
Irises shaded in prelude

00:22:01.269 --> 00:22:07.542
The light's terminal line remains distorted

00:22:07.542 --> 00:22:13.105
And deceives the visualized dream

00:22:15.016 --> 00:22:20.388
In that dark, fictional abyss

00:22:20.388 --> 00:22:26.461
Someday, smash through the imprisoned world

00:22:26.461 --> 00:22:28.429
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:28.429 --> 00:22:30.098
And you will die in your sin

00:22:30.098 --> 00:22:33.301
Slice the cross, is the voice that recites

00:22:33.301 --> 00:22:36.938
A poem of awakening to an absent god

00:22:36.938 --> 00:22:39.774
The blade of sacrilege?

00:22:39.774 --> 00:22:41.376
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:41.376 --> 00:22:43.011
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:43.011 --> 00:22:46.781
An oratorio with you, who have been cut off

00:22:46.781 --> 00:22:49.651
Sorrow is illuminated by the moon

00:22:49.651 --> 00:22:55.248
An eve that leads to a sparkling blue tomorrow

00:23:10.004 --> 00:23:11.072
Next Episode

00:23:11.072 --> 00:23:13.107
Everyone, it's been a while, hasn't it?

00:23:13.107 --> 00:23:14.809
I'm Alexandra Hell.

00:23:14.809 --> 00:23:16.311
Wait, I won't stand for this!

00:23:16.311 --> 00:23:17.512
I won't stand for this!

00:23:17.512 --> 00:23:18.646
Don't say it twice.

00:23:18.646 --> 00:23:20.682
And it's been a while, so do this right.

00:23:20.682 --> 00:23:22.016
It's because it has been a while!

00:23:22.016 --> 00:23:23.551
Just what is Athos thinking?

00:23:23.551 --> 00:23:25.153
You're getting too worked up over the plan.

00:23:25.153 --> 00:23:27.155
Is it all right for me to stay in Athos?

00:23:27.155 --> 00:23:29.057
Anyway, next time on Qwaser of Stigmata II,

00:23:29.057 --> 00:23:29.857
Location of the Magdalene

00:23:29.857 --> 00:23:31.693
"Location of the Magdalene"

00:23:31.693 --> 00:23:34.529
Tremble! Kneel down in fear!

00:23:34.529 --> 00:23:34.927
Location of the Magdalene
